{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28288","headline":"许七侍御弃官东归潇洒江南颇闻自适高秋企望题诗寄赠十韵 · 杜牧","name":"许七侍御弃官东归潇洒江南颇闻自适高秋企望题诗寄赠十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天子绣衣吏，东吴美退居。\n有园同庾信，避事学相如。\n兰畹晴香嫩，筠溪翠影疎。\n江山九秋後，风月六朝余。\n锦帙开诗轴，青囊结道书。\n霜岩红薜荔，露沼白芙蕖。\n睡雨高梧密，棊灯小阁虚。\n冻醪元亮秫，寒鱠季鹰鱼。\n尘意迷今古，云情识卷舒。\n他年雪中櫂，阳羡访吾庐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28288.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28288","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}